sion":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":true,"activityId":"py3.section.c100c19cb9c290cd6c09c608.check","exampleId":"py3.section.c100c19cb9c290cd6c09c608.example","questionId":null,"status":"authored","goal":"能用本节规则解答“[1]+[2] 得到什么？”","body":["完整 Python 的 + 对两个列表进行拼接，所得为新外层列表。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-list#Python%20%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E6%88%AA%E5%8F%96%E4%B8%8E%E6%8B%BC%E6%8E%A5~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-list","order":11,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"Python 列表截取与拼接","titleDisplay":"Python 列表截取与拼接","titlePath":["Python3 列表","Python 列表截取与拼接"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"section","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-list.html","sourceSha256":"96bc5593b832eee979182e921ef95ead8a99756dcd4e21caea2daa76a2a1c8cc","articleSourceOrder":14,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.d3163497e02c85585c74d128","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","leaf":true,"activityId":"py3.practice.slice-copy","exampleId":"py3.section.d3163497e02c85585c74d128.example","questionId":"py3.practice.slice-copy","status":"authored","goal":"区分完整切片和直接赋值，并说明浅拷贝在嵌套列表中的效果。","body":["labels[:] 取得从头到尾的全部项，并分配一个新列表。修改 labels 的第二项只影响原列表的槽位。它的第一项仍是一条指向内部列表的引用。完整切片复制了这条引用，所以从两个外层列表都能看到内部列表追加的值。","跟踪对象表时，先数出两个外层编号，再核对它们的第 0 项是否指向同一内层对象。完整 Python 也允许用 + 拼接两个列表。本课程执行器首版支持列表切片，列表加法留作阅读。"]},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-list#%E5%B5%8C%E5%A5%97%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8~1","parent":"py3-source/python3-list","order":12,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"嵌套列表","titleDisplay":"嵌套列表","titlePath":["Python3 列表","嵌套列表"],"titleOccurrence":1,"role":"section","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-list.html","sourceSha256":"96bc5593b832eee979182e921ef95ead8a99756dcd4e21caea2daa76a2a1c8cc","articleSourceOrder":14,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标