际运行","source":"labels = [[2], 3]\ncopy = labels[:]\n# 外层槽位是独立的，内层列表引用仍共用。\nlabels[1] = 8\ncopy[0].append(6)\nprint(labels, copy, sep='\\n')","sourceSha256":"63348269c85da28da45b3744cb4d80f264ec1e399f977aa39aa99e106da81c8a","cases":[{"name":"外层独立与内层共享","input":"","stdout":"[[2, 6], 8]\n[[2, 6], 3]\n"}]},{"id":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795.example","lessonId":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"x=[[4],[8,9]]，x[1][0] 是多少？","result":"8，先取第二个内层列表再取其首项。"},{"id":"py3.section.eedf3da4332757d836023628.example","lessonId":"py3.section.eedf3da4332757d836023628","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"[1,5] 与 [1,7] 谁更小？","result":"[1,5] 更小，因为第一处差异为 5 与 7。"},{"id":"py3.section.11e8ef40adf511f6eed96177.example","lessonId":"py3.section.11e8ef40adf511f6eed96177","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"执行 result=a.append(3)，result 绑定什么？","result":"None。元素 3 已写入原列表 a。"}],"activities":[{"id":"py3.section.e87a2572760837e53ccbdcfe.check","lessonId":"py3.section.e87a2572760837e53ccbdcfe","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.e87a2572760837e53ccbdcfe.example","prompt":"长度为 3 的列表可读下标 -3 吗？","reveal":"可以，它指向首项。-4 越界。"},{"id":"py3.practice.list-alias","lessonId":"py3.section.397908166650a0ead1f6c4c5","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"py3.practice.list-alias","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"从别名观察列表更新","task":"逐行读取 a 和 b。建立只含 a 的列表，取其第二个名字，通过第二个名字把第一项改为 b，再用第一个名字输出该项。","observation":"两个绑定持有同一对象 ID，修改索引后从原绑定读取该对象","hints":["用第一行输入建立只含一项的列表，再把原来的名字直接赋给新名字。","写入用第二个名字的第 0 项，输出用第一个名字的第 0 项。即使两次输入相等，也应实际执行槽位更新。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"py3.section.842bcbf044599d6b1b5a2652.check","lessonId":"py3.section.842bcbf044599d6b1b5a2652","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.842bcbf044599d6b1b5a2652.example","prompt":"[7,8,9] 执行 pop(1) 后是什么状态？","reveal":"返回 8，列表剩 [7,9]。"},{"id":"py3.section.c100c19cb9c290cd6c09c608.check","lessonId":"py3.section.c100c19cb9c290cd6c09c608","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.c100c19cb9c290cd6c09c608.example","prompt":"[1]+[2] 得到什么？","reveal":"得到 [1,2]，两侧原列表保持各自绑定。"},{"id":"py3.practice.slice-copy","lessonId":"py3.section.d3163497e02c85585c74d128","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"py3.practice.slice-copy","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"区分列表切片与赋值别名","task":"读取 a、b，创建 [a, b]，从完整切片得到第二个列表。把原列表首项改为 b，分别输出原列表和切片的首项。","observation":"切片分配新的列表对象，原列表更新保持两份列表身份","hints":["先用 [:] 取一个新列表，再修改原列表。","分别输出两个第 0 项。如果输入值不同，这两项应呈现修改后的值与原值。检查两个对象编号是否不同。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795.check","lessonId":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.084584d62e2abb452785a795.example","prompt":"x=[[4],[8,9]]，x[1][0] 是多少？","reveal":"8，先取第二个内层列表再取其首项。"},{"id":"py3.section.eedf3da4332757d836023628.check","lessonId":"py3.section.eedf3da4332757d836023628","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.eedf3da4332757d836023628.example","prompt":"[1,5] 与 [1,7] 谁更小？","reveal":"[1,5] 更小，因为第一处差异为 5 与 7。"},{"id":"py3.section.11e8ef40adf511f6eed96177.check","lessonId":"py3.section.11e8ef40adf511f6eed96177","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.11e8ef40adf511f6eed96177.example","prompt":"执行 result=a.append(3)，result 绑定什么？","reveal":"None。元素 3 已写入原列表 a。"}],"references":[]}
